cket-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429161},{"name":"erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","owner":"erinsteiner-NOAA","html_url":"https://github.com/erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Fledgling project to build tools to work with confidential fisheries data","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429162},{"name":"chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","owner":"chiarng","html_url":"https://github.com/chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"App for demoing Jenkins Plugin for ServiceNow CI/CD","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429163},{"name":"davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","owner":"davidklett","html_url":"https://github.com/davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Katacoda Scenarios","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429164},{"name":"Seon2020/reading-notes","owner":"Seon2020","html_url":"https://github.com/Seon2020/reading-notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Code Fellows Reading Notes","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429165},{"name":"dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","owner":"dustyjewett","html_url":"https://github.com/dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A docker image for proxying requests from a client to igdb.","topics":[],"score":178311,"global_rank":429166},{"name":"dblitt/ShulkerStore","owner":"dblitt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblitt/ShulkerStore","stars":0,"forks":0,"w